  "prefLabel": "Puc 2502.36 Revenue quality meter",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2502.36 “Revenue quality meter” means an electricity meter used by a customer-sited source that is of sufficient quality to be eligible for use by a distribution utility to measure for billing purposes the customer’s electricity consumption.\n\nSource. #10741, eff 12-5-14; ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18 (from Puc 2502.32); ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18 (formerly Puc 2502.34)",
